# Git LFS — binary art goes over the LFS API, not the git pack.
#
# WHY: 1,103 MB of this repo's 1,175 MB is binary art, almost all of it the
# vendored Asset Store kits under Assets/_COREHOLD/Vendored/. Those kits are
# load-bearing — 49 committed assets (every Enemy_*.asset, every Tower_*.asset,
# every animator controller, VFXDirectorConfig, Blueprint_SandyDesert) reference
# 525 vendor GUIDs, so they cannot simply be untracked without gutting a fresh
# clone. They have to live somewhere, and the git pack is the wrong place:
# a push becomes one multi-hundred-megabyte HTTPS POST that times out long
# before the bytes finish moving. LFS uploads each object separately and
# resumably, which is what makes the push survive.
#
# EVERY CONTRIBUTOR MUST RUN `git lfs install` ONCE. Cloning without it yields
# small text pointer files where the textures should be, and Unity opens a
# project full of missing references — a failure that looks exactly like the one
# this file exists to prevent. See docs/git_lfs_migration.md.
#
# Unity's YAML (.unity, .prefab, .asset, .mat, .controller, .meta) is
# deliberately NOT here. Those must stay diffable and mergeable; they are also
# only ~64 MB combined, so there is nothing to gain and a merge story to lose.

# ---- textures (516 MB .tga + 425 MB .png + 33 MB .tif today) ----
*.tga  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.png  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.jpg  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.jpeg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.tif  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.tiff filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.psd  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.exr  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.hdr  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# ---- audio (101 MB today, one 56 MB .wav) ----
*.wav  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.mp3  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.ogg  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.aif  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.aiff filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# ---- models (16 MB today, but they only grow) ----
*.fbx  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.obj  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.blend filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# ---- video ----
*.mov  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.mp4  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# ---- packaged assets ----
*.unitypackage filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
